    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424d24249f174309104079f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是大鸣大放还是高尚骏逸，\n都未能在『皋月赏』上夺得胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a68898543836cc2761e2980d9c58d1261acfe6fc4b31ac2cabc67eb708a5f42",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
