    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3c30b029a60bb816660aa57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可比赛中大鸣大放那份压倒性的霸气，以及\n那些战意丝毫不减的劲敌们，却还是单方面\n地震慑住了高尚骏逸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a18908722dde30161325d925565fe43067b7ab109362ad5179db2f48a5aa8efe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089422.json",
      "json_path": [
