    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:681a6cc602f79aaf1491a2c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了掌握同期劲敌们的动向，我带着高尚骏逸\n前来观战『皋月赏』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab5aa712b6c5d2172afc4ddc5b82358e8657780d5b67336dc89374d853594239",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7255efe8df5c450355bffdf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc1c79b8e602f44810a0de4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹、里见皇冠等高尚骏逸的同期俊杰\n们，在这座大舞台上激烈碰撞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d12fe999d2ce643223320da6c80afd282a9d43c83ead4bf3b3a7b09b27bf437",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be9b48606e2a9e9fdbe3180e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aa24fdd92a91718fd7c46ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其中最压倒性的，毫无疑问还是大鸣大放。\n她以让人屏息的狂放末脚，一口气穿透\n人群，夺下了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "392668c050bdc394d15136e145db17fdf78761253e81c15ba38357bdb2e25e92",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a59d66313ca41ceba6dd3e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2472bf19489560721e23330",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然劲敌们的力量远超预想，但能在如今这个阶段\n就意识到这点，反而也是幸运。为了将来真正对决\n的那一天，我们必须继续磨炼实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1e2db9ba3abc38bb254689606134f98564facccdb1a47683ba80f579fd13951",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57b97e412ec4ec7f89e862c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "粗犷的“霸者”",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb81744aee56520e475302c6e58797da95a24b8f4a848c433e2c512b89aa310d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089423.json",
      "json_path": [
