      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deef0e8dd520cbb31728916e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "决定世代最强的『日本德比』，最终由\n高尚骏逸夺得了胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "215b42f8ff11f51978406bc9b2710f5ffe1ec63f947117daa8616ca20f918df2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6a44b9082d773f26164989",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdb6aef5e0453e795929d534",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "落败后的大鸣大放，为了证明“最强”，当场\n宣言将出战『菊花赏』，也把尚未平复心情的\n高尚骏逸再次拉进了胜负之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abc30036aed2f17b2e87dd5e4f7b3210fe46afc35c00b092bf976efde45c5a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f86e7020ceba649428fb25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b652136134d3c169aa2d7e44",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，拥有这种热量的绝不止大鸣大放一个。\n那些不甘败北、将心声全部吼出的劲敌们，让高尚\n骏逸深刻意识到了彼此之间的差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44f4a7d4c04c92d4482ff1a66faf303def31aea3b9fdf2f338c18f45c018da2f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff74a323e069147ad3dfb06",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089424.json",
      "json_path": [
