    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58337d0e7861833628f0c60f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『日本德比』上，大鸣大放以惊人的跑法\n实现了压倒性胜利，向世人充分展现了\n“国内最强”的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b360c270105e145726b0228309128dd9f00925a39ac5d31196b1b6183efdf477",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7339fd2a6e5d2093c8ff8ba1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089425.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f63dd4e7db9dd45b1780b8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "另一方面，看着那些战败后懊悔不已的\n同期赛马娘们，高尚骏逸切身感受到了\n彼此热量上的差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46704efd8b0c9a14a2b03938f4fda68e714fb9a514c531a972fc0b1f6d446355",
