      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "落败后的大鸣大放为了证明“最强”，宣言自己将\n出战『菊花赏』，并在高尚骏逸面前展现出\n丝毫不灭的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "825a60d1e26d4f73352a0fd67bd8c75f5ab2cc42d9d7b8e22fbcc207ae796c31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
