      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛后，目睹同期赛马娘们因败北而懊悔不甘的\n模样，高尚骏逸再度切身体会到了自己与她们\n在热量上的差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4f41c50553f93339063ed9cb36d718a8d68b7722bd54799a354db036b71f2c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1089/storytimeline_501089426.json",
