      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己究竟抱着怎样的觉悟参加了比赛——\n她责备起那个以半吊子心态站上赛场的自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "988f708a32895569487bcd5fbf32ce24609962fea28e358c5fea44929bdbaa68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
