      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而里见皇冠、北部玄驹等同期劲敌们，\n也因此进一步被刺激，对『日本德比』\n投入了更炽热的斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3afa2ecc41ed4e77913724f263d3fa7d4609b5e78d57ed5c28022df1cbf069",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
