    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7be23288b224976cddbd083",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于开始的『日本德比』中，大鸣大放\n以压倒性的惊人跑法夺下胜利，彻底彰显了\n自己“国内最强”的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf4818833ae86710e01eae70a39118de3ec408193677a2a4f8ce760ba37c17bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
