      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在全场欢呼涌向大鸣大放的同时……落败的同期们\n则一个个落泪、颤抖，把各自的想法全部吼了出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "287cf264783c6fb8fc361f83f3e5c8fae288f6b3a2934655dad77ecdff750635",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
